        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/a88e4f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-12-28T03:32:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi.</p>\n<p>I bought the sentinel comics starter kit last spring without knowing about the Kickstarter project. I'm very hype about this game.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Since I missed my chance with the Kickstarter, I'm wondering when the book, GM screen, etc, will be release and, if it's in a long time, if there is a way to have acces to the core book's rules, especially for the character creation system.</p>\n<p>I try to find infos on the internet but I didn't find any about the rules book nor the character creation, except for the character sheet.</p>\n<p>If someone can help me, it will be appreciate.</p>\n<p>Thanks.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:24.587Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
