        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I bought the sentinel comics starter kit last spring without knowing about the Kickstarter project. I'm very hype about this game.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Since I missed my chance with the Kickstarter, I'm wondering when the book, GM screen, etc, will be release and, if it's in a long time, if there is a way to have acces to the core book's rules, especially for the character creation system.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I try to find infos on the internet but I didn't find any about the rules book nor the character creation, except for the character sheet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If someone can help me, it will be appreciate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thanks.</p>",
