        "created_at": "2019-12-28T03:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Except to those who backed directly through KS there are no chapters or anything available to anyone yet until GtG releases the full core Rulebook. &nbsp;If you'd like to preorder you can do so here https://sentinel-comics-rpg.backerkit.com/hosted_preorders&nbsp;but it will not grant you access to the preview chapters through the KS. &nbsp;</p>",
